{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は幕張メッセにて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16枚目シングル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サヨナラの意味"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の全国握手会が開催されました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/23/1214910/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった皆様ありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"過去1の規模の握手会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ、握手会って言うのかしら？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って疑問を抱くくらいミニライブでステージからみた景色は凄かったです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こう言う所で乃木坂の広がり方を実感します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからこそ、冷静にいないとね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近冷静さを保てていないぞ。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しっかりしなきゃ。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダメだぞ〜(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って事で全国握手会のペアは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いおりちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/23/1214910/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いおりちゃんファンの方優しかった(*´꒳`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと楽しい時間を過ごせました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこまふぁむの皆さんもありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/23/1214910/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"並んでくれて、会いに来てくれて本当にありがとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/23/1214910/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男性にも好評でうれしき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/23/1214910/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女性の皆さんも褒めてくれるから本気で照れちゃう(*´꒳`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも大人化計画続けていきますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/23/1214910/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会いに来るなら、今が旬ですよ生駒ちゃん笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ、個別取れるみたいなのでねっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/23/1214910/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃないと、、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうなります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/23/1214910/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぷくーって怒りますよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"柄にもないいきなりキャラ変しちゃいますよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいんですか？？？笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってまーす！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今夜は、ユーリ‼︎!  on  ICE第8話"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/23/1214910/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/23/1214910/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週見事にやられたんでね。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今夜は眠れません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんっとに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんっとに"},{"type":"break"},{"t